1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:02,690
(Howard:)No!

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:04,890
(Sheldon:)This might be a good time
to point out, Howard,

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,360
(Sheldon:)that friendship requires
a certain give and take.

4
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,200
(Sheldon:)Hold the door.

5
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,110
(Doctor:)Mr. Wolowitz?

6
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,940
- Is she okay?
- It wasn't a heart attack.

7
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:23,180
(Doctor:)She's awake, she's
resting comfortably--

8
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,380
(Doctor:)we're still
running a few tests.

9
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,380
(Howard:)Can I see her?

10
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,750
(Doctor:)Actually, she said,
and I quote,

11
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:30,050
she'd "like to see the
little Catholic girl first."

12
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,790
(Bernadette:)Me? Why me?

13
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:37,020
(Howard:)Jews have been asking
that for centuries.

14
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,540
(Howard:)There's no real good answer.

15
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:43,470
(Penny:)Okay, well,
wish me luck.

16
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:44,970
(Howard:)Don't worry,
you'll be fine.

17
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:46,670
(Howard:)Let's just hide Mr. Cross.

18
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:49,600
(Howard:)If it touches her, it burns.

19
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:56,040
(Doctor:)You brought a Catholic girl
home to your mother?

20
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:56,880
(Bernadette:)Yeah.

21
00:00:56,880 --> 00:01:04,020
(Doctor:)Why don't I write you a
prescription for Xanax.

